ido a la reunión","De haber llamado a Mark"]},"answer":"De haber escrito el correo con apuro","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nina escribe: «I regret writing it in such a hurry».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u01-l03-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u01-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u1-apology","document":"email","setting":"Un correo que intenta aclarar un malentendido.","from":"Nina","to":"Mark","title":"About my email","lines":["Hi Mark,","I want to apologize for my email yesterday. I realize it sounded rude, and I regret writing it in such a hurry.","I did not mean to criticize your work. Actually, the report is very good. I only wanted to show you one mistake in the numbers before the meeting.","Next time I will stop to think before I click \"send\". If you have a minute today, I would be happy to talk about it.","Best wishes,","Nina"]},"question":"¿Qué hará Nina la próxima vez?","options":["Parar a pensar antes de hacer clic en «enviar»","Dejar de mandar correos","Pedirle a Mark que revise sus correos","Escribir más rápido"]},"answer":"Parar a pensar antes de hacer clic en «enviar»","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nina escribe: «Next time I will stop to think before I click \"send\"» (stop + to = parar para).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u01-l03-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u01-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I regret saying those things to my brother.","options":["I regret saying those things to my brother.","I regret saying those things to my mother.","I don't regret saying those things to my brother.","I regret not saying those things to my brother."]},"answer":"I regret saying those things to my brother.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es"