el","text":"That sounds fair. Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Great. Please send me the new terms in writing."}]},"question":"¿Cómo termina la negociación?","options":["Con un trato, siempre y cuando el director de Daniel esté de acuerdo","Sin acuerdo","Con un trato firmado ese mismo día","Con una nueva reunión"]},"answer":"Con un trato, siempre y cuando el director de Daniel esté de acuerdo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Daniel dice: «Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u02-l01-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We need to negotiate a better price.","options":["We need to negotiate a better price.","We need to negotiate a better deal.","We want to negotiate a better price.","We don't need to negotiate the price."]},"answer":"We need to negotiate a better price.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-negotiate"]},{"id":"b2-u02-l01-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordená las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Thanks","for","the","proposal","we","will","read","it","carefully"],"translation":"Gracias por la propuesta, la vamos a leer con atención."},"answer":"Thanks for the proposal we will read it carefully.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-proposal"]},{"id":"b2-u02-l01-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l01","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Respondé en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"So, do we agree on the price? (sí, trato hecho)","translation":"Entonces, ¿estamos de acuerdo con el precio?"},"answer":"Yes, we have a deal.","accepted_