,"expected","to","take","place","in","June"],"translation":"Se espera que el festival se realice en junio."},"answer":"The festival is expected to take place in June.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-be-expected-to","en-take-place"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l03-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l03","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Respondé en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"When will the homes be ready? (se espera que estén listas el año que viene)","translation":"¿Cuándo van a estar listas las viviendas?"},"answer":"They are expected to be ready next year.","accepted_answers":["They're expected to be ready next year.","They are expected to be finished next year.","Next year, they are expected to be ready."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-be-expected-to"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l03-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l03","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traducí al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Se dice que la casa tiene doscientos años."},"answer":"It is said that the house is two hundred years old.","accepted_answers":["It's said that the house is two hundred years old.","It is said the house is two hundred years old.","The house is said to be two hundred years old."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-it-is-said"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e01","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Uní cada palabra con su significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"housing","right":"vivienda"},{"left":"take place","right":"tener lugar / realizarse"},{"left":"is being built","right":"se está construyendo"},{"left":"widespread","right":"generalizado / extendido"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-housing","en-take-place","en-being-built","en-widespread"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"A new school is ___ built near my house.","translation":"Se está construyendo una escuela nueva cerca de mi casa.","options":["being","been","be","was"]},"answer":"being","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Pasiva continua: is / are + being + participio.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-being-built"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The roof has already ___ repaired.","translation":"El techo ya fue reparado.","options":["been","being","be","was"]},"answer":"been","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Pasiva en present perfect: has / have + been + participio.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-being-built"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The festival will take ___ in the old market.","translation":"El festival se va a realizar en el mercado viejo.","options":["place","part","time","care"]},"answer":"place","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-take-place"]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-radio","setting":"Un informe en la radio sobre el último censo de una ciudad.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Anna","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Good morning. The results of the new census have just been published. Anna, what do they tell us?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"The population of the city has risen by ten percent in five years, mainly because of young people from other regions."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"And where are they living?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"That's the problem. Housing is very expensive, so the average young person shares a flat until the age of thirty."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is anything being done about it?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"Two thousand new homes are being built near the river, and more are expected to be ready next year."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Thank you, Anna. In other news, the summer festival will take place in the old market this year."}]},"question":"¿Por qué los jóvenes comparten departamento hasta los treinta, según el informe?","options":["Porque la vivienda es muy cara","Porque no consiguen trabajo","Porque prefieren vivir con amigos","Porque estudian hasta los treinta"]},"answer":"Porque la vivienda es muy cara","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Anna dice: «Housing is very expensive, so the average young person shares a flat until the age of thirty».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-radio","setting":"Un informe en la radio sobre el último censo de una ciudad.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Anna","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Good morning. The results of the new census have just been published. Anna, what do they tell us?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"The population of the city has risen by ten percent in five years, mainly because of young people from other regions."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"And where are they living?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"That's the problem. Housing is very expensive, so the average young person shares a flat until the age of thirty."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is anything being done about it?"},{"speaker":"Anna","text":"Two thousand new homes are being built near the river, and more are expected to be ready next year."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Thank you, Anna. In other news, the summer festival will take place in the old market this year."}]},"question":"¿Qué se está haciendo para solucionar el problema?","options":["Se están construyendo dos mil viviendas cerca del río","Se bajaron los alquileres","Se construyó un barrio nuevo","Se cerró el mercado viejo"]},"answer":"Se están construyendo dos mil viviendas cerca del río","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Anna dice: «Two thousand new homes are being built near the river».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l04-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l04","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-market","document":"notice","setting":"Un aviso de la municipalidad sobre el mercado viejo.","title":"Our market is changing","lines":["The old market is being renovated and will be closed until the end of May.","The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month.","The market has been used by local families for more than a hundred years. It is believed to be the oldest building in the neighborhood.","When the work is finished, the market will be used for concerts and festivals. The first festival is expected to take place in June.","Questions can be sent to the community office."]},"question":"¿Qué trabajo ya se terminó en el mercado?","options":["El techo","Las luces","Todo el edificio","La oficina"]},"answer":"El techo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El aviso dice: «The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b