rregla teléfonos.","speakers":[{"name":"Customer","voice":"a"},{"name":"Assistant","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hi. I dropped my phone yesterday and I'd like to have the screen replaced."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Let me see. Yes, we can do that. It's ninety dollars, and it'll be ready tomorrow."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Ninety? That's twice as much as I paid last time!"},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Last time you had a cheaper screen put in. This one is original. The cheaper ones are nowhere near as good."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hmm. Is it worth it? The phone is three years old."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Honestly, the older the phone, the less sense it makes. A new one costs about four hundred."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"I can't afford a new one right now. Go ahead and replace the screen, please."}]},"question":"¿Qué quiere el cliente?","options":["Que le cambien la pantalla del teléfono","Comprar un teléfono nuevo","Que le devuelvan el dinero","Arreglar la pantalla él mismo"]},"answer":"Que le cambien la pantalla del teléfono","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El cliente dice: «I’d like to have the screen replaced».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u05-l03-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u05-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u5-flatmates","setting":"Dos amigos que comparten departamento hablan de plata.","speakers":[{"name":"Jake","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rita","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Jake","text":"I'm thinking of taking out a loan to buy a car."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Are you sure? You still have debt on your credit card."},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"I know, but the bank is offering a low interest rate at the moment."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Low now, but it could rise. And can you really afford the monthly payments?"},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"If I cut back on eating out, I think so."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Why not buy a second-hand car instead? You'd need a much smaller loan, or no loan at all."},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"That's actually a good idea. I'll have a mechanic check a few cars this weekend."}]},"question":"¿Qué va a hacer Jake este fin de semana?","options":["Hacer que un mecánico revise algunos autos","Revisar él mismo los autos","Pedir el préstamo","Vender su auto"]},"answer":"Hacer que un mecánico revise algunos autos","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Jake dice: «I’ll have a mechanic check a few cars this weekend». Have + persona + verbo: otra persona lo hace.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u05-l03-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u05-l03","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I had my phone repaired last week.","options":["I had my phone repaired last week.","I repaired my phone last week.","I had my phone repaired last month.","I have my phone repaired every year."]},"answer":"I had my phone repaired last week.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-have-something-done"]},{"id":"b2-u05-l03-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u05-l03","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordená las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","would","like","to","have","the","screen","replaced"],"translation":"Quisiera que me cambiaran la pantalla."},"answer":"I would like to have the screen replaced.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-have-something-done","en-replace"]},{"id":"b2-u05-l03-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u05-l03","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Respondé en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Your hair looks great! Did 