por lo que dije.","options":["guilty","happy","nervous","proud"]},"answer":"guilty","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-guilty"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l02-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-no-answer","setting":"Dos amigos se preocupan porque una amiga no contesta.","speakers":[{"name":"Max","voice":"a"},{"name":"Eva","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Max","text":"Sara hasn't answered my messages since Friday. That's not like her."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"She must have lost her phone again. She loses it every month."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"She can't have lost it. She posted a photo on social media this morning."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Then she might have been busy with work. She has a big project at the moment."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"Maybe. Or I might have said something that upset her. I made a joke about her new job."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Honestly, you shouldn't have joked about that. She's very nervous about it."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"You're right. I should have thought before I spoke. I'll call her tonight and apologize."}]},"question":"¿Qué opina Eva del chiste de Max?","options":["Que no tendría que haber bromeado sobre eso","Que fue gracioso","Que Sara no lo escuchó","Que no importa"]},"answer":"Que no tendría que haber bromeado sobre eso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Eva dice: «Honestly, you shouldn’t have joked about that. She’s very nervous about it».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u06-l02-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-no-answer","setting":"Dos amigos se preocupan porque una amiga no contes