":"mentalidad / forma de pensar"},{"left":"potential","right":"potencial"},{"left":"motivation","right":"motivación"},{"left":"make progress","right":"progresar / avanzar"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-mindset","en-potential","en-motivation","en-make-progress"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"You are ___ great progress with your English.","translation":"Estás progresando mucho con tu inglés.","options":["making","doing","having","taking"]},"answer":"making","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Collocation: make progress (no «do progress»).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-make-progress"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Good teachers help students reach their ___.","translation":"Los buenos profesores ayudan a los alumnos a desarrollar su potencial.","options":["potential","mindset","motivation","talent"]},"answer":"potential","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-potential"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de divulgación sobre la mentalidad de crecimiento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"¿Qué piensan las personas con «mentalidad fija» cuando algo les cuesta?","options":["Que simplemente no son buenas para eso","Que tienen que practicar más","Que el profesor es malo","Que es cuestión de tiempo"]},"answer":"Que simplemente no son buenas para eso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de divulgación sobre la mentalidad de crecimiento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Para quien tiene «mentalidad de crecimiento», ¿qué es un error?","options":["Información que muestra qué practicar después","Un fracaso","Una razón para abandonar","Algo que hay que ocultar"]},"answer":"Información que muestra qué practicar después","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de divulgación sobre la mentalidad de crecimiento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"¿Qué ayuda a que los alumnos sigan motivados más tiempo?","options":["Ver su propio progreso","Sacar buenas notas","Tener talento","Estudiar solos"]},"answer":"Ver su propio progreso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «students who see their progress stay motivated for longer».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l03-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Motivation comes and goes.","options":["Motivation comes and goes.","Motivation comes and stays.","Motivation goes and comes back.","Money comes and goes."]},"answer":"Mo