_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-procrastinate","en-self-discipline","en-keep-track-of","en-catch-up"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I keep ___ of my study hours in a notebook.","translation":"Llevo la cuenta de mis horas de estudio en un cuaderno.","options":["track","list","time","care"]},"answer":"track","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-keep-track-of"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I missed two classes, so I need to catch ___.","translation":"Falté a dos clases, así que tengo que ponerme al día.","options":["up","on","out","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-catch-up"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Una publicación de blog sobre dejar de postergar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Según el autor, ¿qué lo ayudó a dejar de postergar?","options":["La autodisciplina: una rutina que funciona aun en los días malos","La motivación","Un profesor particular","Apagar el teléfono"]},"answer":"La autodisciplina: una rutina que funciona aun en los días malos","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Escribe: «What finally helped was not motivation… What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Una publicación de blog sobre dejar de postergar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"¿Qué hace con cada sesión de estudio?","options":["La anota en un cuaderno y le gusta ver crecer la lista","La graba en video","La comparte en las redes","Se la muestra a un amigo"]},"answer":"La anota en un cuaderno y le gusta ver crecer la lista","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Escribe: «I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Un estudiante habla con una tutora de la universidad.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"¿Por qué Ivan piensa en dejar la facultad?","options":["Faltó seis semanas por el trabajo y cree que no se va a poder poner al día","No le gusta su carrera","Le ofrecieron un trabajo mejor","Desaprobó un examen"]},"answer":"Faltó seis semanas por el trabajo y cree que no se va a poder poner al día","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan dice: «I’ve missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I’ll never catch up».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l04-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l04","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Learning a language takes self-discipline.","options":["Learning a language takes self-discipline.","Learning a language takes a lot of time.","Learning a language takes motivation.","Teaching a language takes self-discipline.