"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Un estudiante habla con una tutora de la universidad.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"¿Qué le ofrece la tutora a Ivan?","options":["Una beca para estudiantes que trabajan, que le paga la cuota","Un trabajo en la universidad","Más tiempo para el examen","Cambiarlo de carrera"]},"answer":"Una beca para estudiantes que trabajan, que le paga la cuota","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La tutora pregunta por «our scholarship for working students» y explica: «It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Un estudiante habla con una tutora de la universidad.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"¿Qué habría hecho distinto Ivan si hubiera sabido antes de la beca?","options":["No habría tomado tantos turnos de trabajo","No se habría inscripto","Habría cambiado de trabajo","Habría dejado antes la facultad"]},"answer":"No habría tomado tantos turnos de trabajo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan dice: «If I’d known about it earlier, I wouldn’t have taken so many shifts».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Una publicación de blog sobre dejar de postergar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"¿Qué le recomienda el autor a quien nunca probó su método?","options":["Que lo pruebe, aunque al principio se sienta raro","Que no lo intente","Que pida ayuda a un experto","Que estudie más horas seguidas"]},"answer":"Que lo pruebe, aunque al principio se sienta raro","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Escribe: «If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"She won a scholarship to study abroad.","options":["She won a scholarship to study abroad.","She won a prize to study abroad.","She won a scholarship to work abroad.","He won a scholarship to study abroad."]},"answer":"She won a scholarship to study abroad.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-scholarship"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordená las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","have","enrolled","in","an","evening","course"],"translation":"Me anoté en un curso nocturno."},"answer":"I have enrolled in an evening course.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-enroll"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Respondé en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"I'm scared of singing in public. (animalo: que lo pruebe)","translation":"Me da miedo cantar en público."},"answer":"Give it a try!","accepted_answers":["Just give it a try!","You should give it a try.","Give it a try."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-give-it-a-try"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l05-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l05","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traducí al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Ganó una beca para estudiar en el exterior."},"answer":"She won a scholarship to study abroad.","accepted_answers":["He won a scholarship to study abroad.","She got a scholarship to study abroad.","He got a scholarship to study abroad."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-scholarship"]},{"id":"b2-u09-listen-e01","lesson_id":"b2-u09-listen","position":1,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"motivation","options":["motivation","make progress","would have","potential"]},"answer":"motivation","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-motivation"]},{"id":"b2-u09-listen-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u09-listen","position":2,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"keep track of","options":["keep track of","catch up","procrastinate","drop out"]},"answer":"keep track of","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-keep-track-of"]},{"id":"b2-u09-listen-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u09-listen","position":3,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I often look back on my school days.","options":["I often look back on my school days.","I never look back on my school days.","I often look back on my university days.","I often think about my school friends."]},"answer":"I often look back on my school days.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-look-back-on"]},{"id":"b2-u09-listen-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u09-listen","position":4,"typ