","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"¿Qué le recuerda Rosa a Alice?","options":["Que si hubiera aceptado el trabajo en Berlín, ahora hablaría alemán","Que en Berlín le fue mal","Que nunca le ofrecieron nada en Berlín","Que sus padres viven en Lisboa"]},"answer":"Que si hubiera aceptado el trabajo en Berlín, ahora hablaría alemán","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rosa dice: «If you had taken it, you’d be speaking German by now» (pasado distinto → presente distinto).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l02-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Una amiga le cuenta a otra que tiene que decidir si se muda por trabajo.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"¿Qué le dice su intuición a Alice y por qué duda?","options":["Que vaya, pero duda por sus padres, que están más grandes","Que se quede, porque no le gusta Lisboa","Que vaya, porque el sueldo es alto","No tiene ninguna intuición"]},"answer":"Que vaya, pero duda por sus padres, que están más grandes","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Alice dice: «To go. But I’m having second thoughts because of my parents. They’re getting older».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l02-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-guide","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo sobre cómo tomar decisiones importantes.","title":"How to make a big decision","lines":["Big decisions are hard because there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security.","First, write down the pros and cons. Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly.","Second, ask yourself what is really at stake. Will this matter in five years? If not, do not spend weeks on it.","Third, listen to your gut feeling. Research suggests that our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of.","Finally, accept that no decision is perfect. If we had a crystal ball, we would never make mistakes. We do not, so we learn from them."]},"question":"¿Qué dice el artículo sobre la intuición?","options":["Que la primera reacción suele tener información de la que no somos conscientes","Que no hay que hacerle caso","Que siempre acierta","Que es sólo para decisiones chicas"]},"answer":"Que la primera reacción suele tener información de la que no somos conscientes","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l02-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"If I were braver, I would have said yes.","options":["If I were braver, I would have said yes.","If I were braver, I would say yes.","If I had been braver, I would have said yes.","If I were braver, I would have said no."]},"answer":"If I were braver, I would have said yes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u12-l02-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordená las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["My","gut","feeling","says","I","should","go"],"translation":"Mi intuición me dice que tengo que ir."},"answer":"My gut feeling says I should go.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-gut-feeling"]},{"id":"b2-u12-l02-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l02","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Respondé en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why are you so tired today? (si no te hubieras acostado tan tarde, no estarías cansado)","translation":"¿Por qué 