o, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"¿Qué cree Sam que conviene hacer?","options":["Llamar a Mark, porque el tono no siempre se entiende por escrito","Mandarle otro correo a Mark","No decir nada","Hablar con el jefe"]},"answer":"Llamar a Mark, porque el tono no siempre se entiende por escrito","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sam dice: «A call is better than another email. Tone doesn’t always get across in writing».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.u1h9c7mry3s8tc","content_hash":"v1:3fc7f8297b2bba56356730cbab31e879ac2b73f74f3e9ef01ba50032b3235da4","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","options":["It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","It was an argument, not a misunderstanding.","It wasn't an accident, just a misunderstanding.","It wasn't an argument, just a mistake."]},"answer":"It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.cfb6yp4xwje7w7","content_hash":"v1:dc39d9c8095d8773cf95dc1716835ebd7fb300c008dfc816dafdcf35734f733b","prompt_es":"Ordená las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","did","not","mean","to","sound","angry"],"translation":"No fue mi intención sonar enojado."},"answer":"I did not mean to sound angry.","accepted_answers":[],"ex