ay.\""},{"speaker":"Ivy","text":"I did. Apparently she was talking about Tom. He always forgets his wallet."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"So she was implying that he never pays? That was a pretty strong hint."},{"speaker":"Ivy","text":"Well, I don't think she meant to embarrass him. She was being sarcastic, but in a friendly way."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"Tom didn't seem to find it funny, though. He went quiet for the rest of the night."},{"speaker":"Ivy","text":"Maybe I'll bring it up with Carla. She'd want to know he was hurt."}]},"question":"¿Qué piensa hacer Ivy?","options":["Hablar del tema con Carla","Pedirle perdón a Tom","Invitar a Tom a cenar","No meterse"]},"answer":"Hablar del tema con Carla","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivy dice: «Maybe I’ll bring it up with Carla. She’d want to know he was hurt».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.9iw1grwf7q4v8e","content_hash":"v1:53da1320d641a385fa65d77b5c448c89a2fe7c11cabc509443093fe8e280a1bb","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u1-email-tone","setting":"Dos compañeros de trabajo hablan de un correo que cayó mal.","speakers":[{"name":"Nina","voice":"a"},{"name":"Sam","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Can I ask you something? Did my email this morning seem rude to you?"},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Honestly? It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"¿Qué explica Ni