":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"¿Qué le reprocha Lucas a Hannah?","options":["Que lo que dice es una suposición sin pruebas","Que habla demasiado","Que cambió de opinión","Que no respondió la pregunta"]},"answer":"Que lo que dice es una suposición sin pruebas","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Lucas dice: «But that’s an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.w2o877vgdgebxl","content_hash":"v1:46999b359244624aab07af38f1394ebe232b2dba0f468ea74d52c5452df379da","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-four-days","setting":"Unos colegas discuten la propuesta de trabajar cuatro días por semana.","speakers":[{"name":"Olivia","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ken","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"So, the four-day week. What worries me is the customers. Who answers the phone on Fridays?"},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"We'd take turns. The reason why other companies have done it is that people work better when they're rested."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"That may be true for some jobs. But we need to take into account that our clients expect us every day."},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"That's a valid point. So let's try it for three months and measure the results."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"OK, I find that convincing. All things considered, a trial is a good compromise."}]},"question":"¿Qué pide Olivia que se tenga en cuenta y cómo responde Ken?","options":["Que los clientes los esperan todos los días; Ken lo acepta y propone una prueba de tres meses","Que es caro; Ken lo niega","Que nadie quiere trabajar los viernes; Ken se enoja","Que es ilegal; Ken lo duda"]},"answ