.j4mvvd8ihet6dc","content_hash":"v1:2ce341e104e4900941dc5038a286a0939f28a11a54a248a876606a52f49723b0","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"To sum ___, I think the plan is a good idea.","translation":"En resumen, creo que el plan es una buena idea.","options":["up","out","on","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.60nm0x5o9jtxrt","content_hash":"v1:b11508aee84ff4bb6ae010d890e33fe4b99bf269433f810090ce36157a793489","prompt_es":"Leé y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de opinión sobre la universidad gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"¿Con qué idea cierra la autora?","options":["Que la universidad gratuita es una inversión en todos, no un regalo","Que la universidad debería ser más barata","Que los estudiantes deben pagar","Que el gobierno gasta mal"]},"answer":"Que la universidad gratuita es una inversión en todos, no un regalo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo termina: «To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us».","difficulty":1,"recommended_second